  "decisionSummary": "v8 五节点模型服务端落地(R-85/R-93/R-95)与前端准入/类型对齐。v7 三值 kind(text/image/video) 迁移为 v8 七值 kind(输入层 text/image/video + 生成层 image-generator/video-generator + 结果层 result-image/result-video)，WORKFLOW_SCHEMA_VERSION=8，workflowSchema.ts 重写 validateAndMigrateFlow(C1-C7 校验 + v7→v8 迁移 M1-M8)。付费/Provider 节点判定从 kind==='image' 统一改为 generationKindOf(step.kind)==='image'(image-generator→image 语义归一)，evaluationAuthorizationLedger/evaluationEvidence/evaluationRunPolicy/runPlan/generate/runner/dag 各处判定一并迁移；模型×节点闸 isModelAllowedForNode 与 promptRunAdmission 绑定按生成语义 kind 归一，promptRunAdmission 增加 nodeKindMatchesCatalogAxis 过渡桥兼容目录轴(image-generator↔image、video-generator↔video)。RunEvent/RunFailure/RunEventMeta 从 runner.ts 收敛到 workflow.ts 单点。画幅取值新增 IMAGE_ASPECT_RATIO_OPTIONS/imageAspectRatioOptions 单一事实源：契约声明 aspectRatios 时以契约为准，未声明时回落业务画幅清单 1:1/3:4/4:3/9:16/16:9。参考图来源从仅 image 节点扩展为 image + result-image。决策依据：API易图片/视频生成模型能力页(参考图 order-only、画幅、batchSize 张数)与 v8 设计契约 docs/design/2026-09-21-five-node-model/contracts/*(含 C7/§0.2 裁定)。本次改动不新增/变更任何模型 ID、Provider 端点或计费契约，仅结构 kind 迁移与准入/闸归一。",
